id=unbothered-tune
name=Unbothered memory tuning
version=1.0
versionCode=1
author=Aqirul2411
description=Turns zram on if init did not, then applies three vm tunables that only make sense with compressed swap. Disable in the manager to undo everything; nothing here survives a reboot except the tuned values, and those revert when the module is off.
